# The jobs of a small server, in UTC.
*/20 9-17 * * mon-fri   poll the feed
30 12 * * *             lunch reminder
0 0 * * *               rotate the logs
0 3 1 * *               archive the month
@weekly                 back up the disk
0 9 13 * FRI            Friday the 13th, or any 13th, or any Friday
